  "details": "A lot of RP servers seem to have RNG dice built into their avatars, but I think it would be a good idea to just add different types of dice and RNG to the emoji menu so you could roll a D20 or other types etc with ALL avatars and EVERYWHERE. \nThe emoji menu would have the different types of rng/dice and if you click on it, it would launch an emoji with an maybe a rolling animation for that emoji and then the emoji with the RNG value and that value would be synced for everyone of course to prevent confusions on what the roll was.\nThis would be pretty useful on rp type encounters in publics too to settle things and such or things of that nature.\nheads or tails, d20, d10, d6, d100 etc would be nice to have",
